backgrounds. You'll notice they come

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:42.959
from all walks of life. You've got

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:44.640
nurses, you've got engineers, you've got

00:09:42.959 --> 00:09:46.231
people coming straight out of college.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.360
The future of education looks like this.

00:09:46.231 --> 00:09:49.200
[music] And here's why we think that's

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:51.440
so important. Last year, newspapers

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:52.880
reported on Mr. Yokohama, a 73-year-old

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:55.279
logistics business [music] owner in

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:57.760
northern Japan who did something crazy.

00:09:55.279 --> 00:10:00.320
He had a 30% profit margin, 17

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:01.839
employees, equipment, nearly 150 acres

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:03.839
of land. [music] Yet, he gave it all

00:10:01.839 --> 00:10:06.080
away completely for free. Because in

00:10:03.839 --> 00:10:07.360
Japan, business sales aren't the norm.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.959
Traditionally, you pass down a company

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:10.480
to a family member or apprentice, but

00:10:08.959 --> 00:10:11.760
there was no one left to take it. His

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:13.680
children didn't want it, not his

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:15.360
employees, no young people in the town.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:17.120
They'd moved to big cities. So, he

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:18.959
listed the business for free on the

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:21.040
condition that someone, anyone, moved to

00:10:18.959 --> 00:10:22.800
his small town, learn the trade, keep it

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:24.560
running. And he's not alone. Look at

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:26.079
what's happening in Japan. Japan is

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.680
facing a demographic crisis that

00:10:26.079 --> 00:10:29.200
threatens the survival of thousands of

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:30.640
businesses. [music] Young people aren't

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:32.240
getting married, so it makes sense that

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:36.079
the birth rates are at an all-time low,

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:38.399
too. The result, in 2021, 44,000

00:10:36.079 --> 00:10:39.839
businesses in Japan were abandoned. More

00:10:38.399 --> 00:10:41.440
than half of them were still profitable

00:10:39.839 --> 00:10:43.600
when they closed. And the problem is

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:45.680
about to get worse. Japan now has an

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:48.160
estimated 2.5 million businesses owned

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:49.767
by people in their 70s. Most of them do

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:53.279
not have a plan for their secession.

00:10:49.767 --> 00:10:56.320
[music] In 2019, Japan's government said

00:10:53.279 --> 00:10:58.480
it was going to be so bad by 2030 that

00:10:56.320 --> 00:11:02.000
630,000 profitable businesses would

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:05.040
close, costing [music] $165 billion and

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:07.200
$6.5 million jobs. That's almost 10% of

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:09.360
their entire workforce. For context,

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:11.680
during the Great Depression, we had 24%

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:13.920
unemployment at the peak. That would be

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:16.720
almost half of that. Now, that may be

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:17.760
Japan's fate, 5,000 miles away, but I

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:21.120
want to make sure this never happens

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:22.640
here. I want you as an aspiring business

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:24.640
owner to have the skills, network, and

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:26.399
education to thrive. Like, if you want

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:27.839
to run a plumbing business or a car

00:11:26.399 --> 00:11:29.839
wash, you don't need two years and a

00:11:27.839 --> 00:11:31.440
quarter million just for tuition. Every

00:11:29.839 --> 00:11:33.040
profitable business can continue to live

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:34.800
on if you actually learn how to take up

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:36.240
the baton. You know, this country, we

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:38.160
were entrepreneurs from the start. We

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:40.399
were a group of ludicrous idealists who

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:42.000
decided we'd rather get on a boat, leave

00:11:40.399 --> 00:11:43.600
everything behind, and build something

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.279
great rather than [music] settle for

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:46.880
somebody else being in charge. Everybody

00:11:45.279 --> 00:11:49.760
else thought that was dumb, and I think

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:52.000
that we were right, as showed by the GDP

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:53.680
of this country versus the others. More

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.519
than 5 million small business

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:58.000
applications have been filed every year

00:11:55.519 --> 00:11:59.760
since 2021. We should be damn proud of

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:01.519
this and unrelenting in the support of

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:02.959
them so we never lose this spirit. You

00:12:01.519 --> 00:12:04.480
want to know what unites Americans more

00:12:02.959 --> 00:12:06.160
than anything else? The institution that

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:08.639
nine out of ten of Americans agree is

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:13.120
the most positive force in our country.

00:12:08.639 --> 00:12:15.680
Church, no education, no military, no

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:18.160
small business. You focus your efforts

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:20.079
there, you make more money and maybe the

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:21.600
nation gets more secure. And if we do

00:12:20.079 --> 00:12:23.200
focus here, I think we'll see the fruits

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:24.560
for decades to come. Which brings me

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.680
back to where we started. If you wanted

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:27.200
to learn how to actually build a

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:29.120
business today, not raise venture

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:31.360
dollars, not chase hype, but [music] buy

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:32.639
something real built to thrive in the AI

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:34.079
age, something you could hand to your

00:12:32.639 --> 00:12:35.200
kids, something that leaves a mark on

00:12:34.079 --> 00:12:36.800
