00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:40.959
relatively quickly and affordably, then

00:12:38.639 --> 00:12:42.880
there's only one place to do this, and

00:12:40.959 --> 00:12:44.160
that's what we call owner nation. You're

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:46.560
already here with us [music] learning

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:48.320
